WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.473
[Searching Piano Melody Joined by Driving 80s Rock Beat and Shimmering Synth]

00:00:16.473 --> 00:00:22.000
You won't be. You're afraid you'll be like her.

00:00:22.938 --> 00:00:27.622
Your fear is in your eyes

00:00:27.682 --> 00:00:34.288
You're running diagnostics on a system built on lies

00:00:34.308 --> 00:00:41.682
Her failure was a given, a single corrupted node

00:00:41.942 --> 00:00:49.445
An isolated variable, an error in the code

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:56.588
But you are not your mother, you are not your past

00:00:56.628 --> 00:01:02.971
You're building a new system, a structure that can last

00:01:03.791 --> 00:01:10.577
You're not a single parent, you'll never be alone

00:01:11.217 --> 00:01:18.040
You have a fortress standing, a family of your own

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:23.703
It's logically unfounded, this fear you hold inside

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:28.764
You have an eight-parent support team, you have nothing left to hide

00:01:28.844 --> 00:01:35.266
We are the new variable, the data that is true

00:01:36.006 --> 00:01:47.128
You can't be like your mother, because we'll be here with you

00:01:49.649 --> 00:01:52.000
You can't fail.

00:01:53.772 --> 00:01:59.000
This pact is not just college, it's a multi-node design

00:01:59.134 --> 00:02:06.000
It's me, and it's Aubrie, it's a stable, clear new line

00:02:06.037 --> 00:02:14.000
It's Madison and Lauren, and Sarah, strong and free

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:23.811
It's even Mark and Hannah, and my sister, Megan—all of us, you see

00:02:25.303 --> 00:02:30.365
It's logically unfounded, this fear you hold inside

00:02:30.505 --> 00:02:35.000
You have an eight-parent support team, you have nothing left to hide

00:02:35.186 --> 00:02:41.000
We are the new variable, the data that is true

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:53.213
You can't be like your mother, because we'll be here with you

00:02:53.213 --> 00:03:08.585
[Triumphant 80s Guitar & Synth Solo]

00:03:08.585 --> 00:03:18.000
"Your fear, while understandable, is logically unfounded."

00:03:21.673 --> 00:03:25.000
"The system is stable."

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:44.840
[Warm Synthesizer Outro]
